{"id":2225,"date":"2024-09-19T12:31:47","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:31:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2225"},"modified":"2025-10-02T08:57:23","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T08:57:23","slug":"4x4-cardboard-boxes","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/4x4-cardboard-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"4&#215;4 Cardboard Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"50\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"50\">Custom 4&#215;4 Cardboard Boxes at Wholesale Prices<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"52\" data-end=\"365\">We at <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\"><em data-start=\"58\" data-end=\"80\">Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/em><\/a> offer high-quality <strong data-start=\"100\" data-end=\"123\">4&#215;4 cardboard boxes<\/strong> made specifically for brands and businesses that require small but secure packaging. Whether you&#8217;re packaging cosmetics, candles, accessories, samples, or other compact products, our boxes provide a clean and protective packaging solution.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"367\" data-end=\"596\">If you&#8217;re searching for <strong data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"424\">4&#215;4 cardboard boxes wholesale<\/strong> or need <strong data-start=\"433\" data-end=\"463\">4&#215;4 cardboard boxes nearby<\/strong> for quick delivery, we\u2019ve got you covered. All boxes can be custom-printed, coated, and shaped to fit your specific packaging needs.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"601\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"603\" data-end=\"637\">Compact Boxes with a Big Impact<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"683\">Ideal for Retail, E-commerce, and Events<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"855\">These boxes are compact but deliver high performance. From protecting fragile items to presenting branded gifts, <strong data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"821\">4&#215;4 cardboard boxes<\/strong> offer flexibility and durability.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"1015\">\n<li data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"916\">\n<p data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"916\">Great for packaging soaps, supplements, and sample jars<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"960\">\n<p data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"960\">Easily stacked for storage and shipping<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"1015\">\n<p data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"1015\">Lightweight yet sturdy material for product safety<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1122\">Whether you\u2019re shipping nationally or stocking shelves, these boxes hold up through handling and transit.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1148\">Built with Precision<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1265\">Every box is made using high-grade materials such as corrugated cardboard, white SBS, or eco Kraft board. We offer:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1398\">\n<li data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1300\">\n<p data-start=\"1269\" data-end=\"1300\">Die-cut options for snug fits<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1301\" data-end=\"1346\">\n<p data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1346\">Locking tabs and flaps for added security<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1398\">\n<p data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1398\">Plain or printed designs depending on your need<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1487\">Flat-packed boxes ensure efficient storage until you\u2019re ready to assemble and use them.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1492\" \/>\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_80l1q_1\">\n<div class=\"_tableWrapper_80l1q_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"sticky end-(--thread-content-margin) h-0 self-end select-none\">\n<div class=\"absolute end-0 flex items-end\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Feature<\/th>\n<th>Description<\/th>\n<th>Material Options<\/th>\n<th>Finishing Choices<\/th>\n<th>Add-ons &amp; Features<\/th>\n<th>Usage\/Application<\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Dimensions<\/td>\n<td>4&#8243; x 4&#8243; x Custom Height<\/td>\n<td>White SBS, Corrugated E-Flute, Kraft Board<\/td>\n<td>Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<td>Die-cuts, Window Patch, Divider Inserts<\/td>\n<td>Retail packaging, cosmetics, small gifts, samples<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Options<\/td>\n<td>Premium grade boards for durability and protection<\/td>\n<td>SBS Board, Kraft Board, Corrugated Board<\/td>\n<td>Lamination, Soft Touch, Foiling<\/td>\n<td>Eco-friendly ink, Recycled stock<\/td>\n<td>Food packaging, subscription kits, luxury goods<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Printing Options<\/td>\n<td>Multiple print methods for branding<\/td>\n<td>CMYK, PMS, Single Color, Full Color<\/td>\n<td>Offset &amp; Digital Printing<\/td>\n<td>Logo branding, QR Codes, Inside Printing<\/td>\n<td>Product branding, instructions, promotional text<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Coating Choices<\/td>\n<td>Protective coatings to improve surface look and durability<\/td>\n<td>Gloss Aqueous, Matte Aqueous, UV Coatings<\/td>\n<td>Spot UV, Anti-scratch, Soft Touch<\/td>\n<td>Smudge resistance, Moisture protection<\/td>\n<td>Premium retail boxes, outdoor storage<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Closure Styles<\/td>\n<td>Functional designs for easy assembly and secure sealing<\/td>\n<td>Tuck End, Auto Lock Bottom, Lid &amp; Base<\/td>\n<td>Foil stamping, Debossing, Embossing<\/td>\n<td>Tear-resistant tabs, Locking flaps<\/td>\n<td>Gift packaging, bakery items, lightweight goods<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Design Proof<\/td>\n<td>Visual confirmation before production<\/td>\n<td>Digital 3D Mock-up, Flat PDF, Hard Sample<\/td>\n<td>Gloss, Matte, Texture Overlay<\/td>\n<td>Artwork alignment, Color accuracy adjustments<\/td>\n<td>Final approval for print runs<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Order Quantity<\/td>\n<td>Starts from 100 Units \u2013 Bulk discounts available<\/td>\n<td>Small Batch, Bulk Orders<\/td>\n<td>Standard or Premium Print Finish<\/td>\n<td>MOQ flexibility, Wholesale pricing<\/td>\n<td>Startups, wholesalers, retail chains<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Turnaround Time<\/td>\n<td>4\u20136 Business Days, Rush production available<\/td>\n<td>Standard lead times, Express production<\/td>\n<td>Rush Spot UV, Express Embossing<\/td>\n<td>Same-day processing, Priority handling<\/td>\n<td>Seasonal campaigns, urgent retail orders<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shipping<\/td>\n<td>Free nationwide delivery, safe and reliable packaging<\/td>\n<td>Flat-pack delivery in corrugated cartons<\/td>\n<td>Matte or Gloss exterior wrap<\/td>\n<td>Tracking, Insurance, International shipping<\/td>\n<td>E-commerce, retail stores, export packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Design Support<\/td>\n<td>Free artwork assistance for professional layouts<\/td>\n<td>Artwork proofing with die-line templates<\/td>\n<td>Finishing sample recommendations<\/td>\n<td>Logo placement, Branding consultation<\/td>\n<td>Startups, businesses needing branding support<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<hr data-start=\"2828\" data-end=\"2831\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"2833\" data-end=\"2869\">Cardboard Boxes by Size and Shape<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"2871\" data-end=\"2922\">Customization That Matches Product Requirements<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"2924\" data-end=\"3148\">We understand how important accurate sizing is when it comes to packaging. That\u2019s why our <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/cardboard-boxes-by-size-and-shape\/\"><strong data-start=\"3014\" data-end=\"3051\">Cardboard Boxes by Size and Shape<\/strong><\/a> service allows you to request specific heights or modifications to your <strong data-start=\"3124\" data-end=\"3147\">4&#215;4 cardboard boxes<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"3150\" data-end=\"3314\">\n<li data-start=\"3150\" data-end=\"3196\">\n<p data-start=\"3152\" data-end=\"3196\">Add die-cut windows for product visibility<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3197\" data-end=\"3246\">\n<p data-start=\"3199\" data-end=\"3246\">Include interior printing for added messaging<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3247\" data-end=\"3314\">\n<p data-start=\"3249\" data-end=\"3314\">Choose flap styles that align with your brand\u2019s packaging goals<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"3316\" data-end=\"3404\">We also offer batch labeling or QR code printing for inventory and shipping convenience.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"3406\" data-end=\"3449\">Applications Across Multiple Industries<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3451\" data-end=\"3507\">Our 4&#215;4 boxes are trusted by a wide range of businesses:<\/p>\n<ol data-start=\"3509\" data-end=\"3754\">\n<li data-start=\"3509\" data-end=\"3571\">\n<p data-start=\"3512\" data-end=\"3571\"><strong data-start=\"3512\" data-end=\"3542\">Health and Wellness Brands<\/strong> \u2013 Supplements, jars, vials<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3572\" data-end=\"3631\">\n<p data-start=\"3575\" data-end=\"3631\"><strong data-start=\"3575\" data-end=\"3591\">Retail Shops<\/strong> \u2013 Gift items, jewelry, handmade goods<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3632\" data-end=\"3692\">\n<p data-start=\"3635\" data-end=\"3692\"><strong data-start=\"3635\" data-end=\"3653\">Event Planners<\/strong> \u2013 Party favors, invitation packaging<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3693\" data-end=\"3754\">\n<p data-start=\"3696\" data-end=\"3754\"><strong data-start=\"3696\" data-end=\"3717\">E-commerce Brands<\/strong> \u2013 Trial kits, samples, accessories<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p data-start=\"3756\" data-end=\"3858\">Their compact structure makes them easy to display and ship without wasting space or increasing costs.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"3860\" data-end=\"3863\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"3865\" data-end=\"3913\">Printing and Coating Options for Brand Impact<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"3915\" data-end=\"3948\">Finish Options That Add Value<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3950\" data-end=\"4069\">Every box can be finished with a texture or shine that boosts its appearance and gives your product a competitive edge.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"4071\" data-end=\"4241\">\n<li data-start=\"4071\" data-end=\"4129\">\n<p data-start=\"4073\" data-end=\"4129\"><strong data-start=\"4073\" data-end=\"4090\">Gloss Coating<\/strong>: Reflective finish with visual shine<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4130\" data-end=\"4183\">\n<p data-start=\"4132\" data-end=\"4183\"><strong data-start=\"4132\" data-end=\"4149\">Matte Coating<\/strong>: Smooth, non-reflective surface<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4184\" data-end=\"4241\">\n<p data-start=\"4186\" data-end=\"4241\"><strong data-start=\"4186\" data-end=\"4197\">Spot UV<\/strong>: Highlights specific text or design areas<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"4243\" data-end=\"4360\">These finishes not only improve aesthetics but also protect the box surface from scratches and marks during handling.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"4362\" data-end=\"4400\">Professional Printing Capabilities<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"4402\" data-end=\"4491\">Whether you need simple branding or full-color artwork, we offer the tools and expertise:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"4493\" data-end=\"4602\">\n<li data-start=\"4493\" data-end=\"4523\">\n<p data-start=\"4495\" data-end=\"4523\">Front-panel logo placement<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4524\" data-end=\"4562\">\n<p data-start=\"4526\" data-end=\"4562\">All-over printing with vibrant ink<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4563\" data-end=\"4602\">\n<p data-start=\"4565\" data-end=\"4602\">Interior flaps with custom messages<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"4604\" data-end=\"4722\">We use food-safe and eco-friendly inks for both plain and coated boxes, ideal for retail and eco-conscious businesses.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"4724\" data-end=\"4727\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"244\" data-end=\"287\">Why Choose 4&#215;4 Cardboard Boxes Wholesale<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"289\" data-end=\"322\">The Benefits of Bulk Ordering<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"324\" data-end=\"485\">Ordering <strong data-start=\"333\" data-end=\"366\">4&#215;4 cardboard boxes wholesale<\/strong> helps save time, money, and management resources\u2014especially for brands handling repeat shipments or high sales volume.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"659\">\n<li data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"531\">\n<p data-start=\"489\" data-end=\"531\">Lower cost per unit when ordered in bulk<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"532\" data-end=\"574\">\n<p data-start=\"534\" data-end=\"574\">Quicker reorders with stored templates<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"614\">\n<p data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"614\">Consistent quality across all units<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"659\">\n<p data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"659\">Reduced packaging delays in busy seasons<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"661\" data-end=\"1035\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Some businesses prefer using compact options like <strong data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"799\"><a class=\"\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cube-cardboard-boxes\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"797\">Cube Cardboard Boxes<\/a><\/strong> when working with smaller product dimensions, especially in subscription kits or retail setups. Whether you operate a home-based shop or manage a chain of outlets, having a ready stock of standardized boxes streamlines your operations.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"5291\" data-end=\"5294\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"5296\" data-end=\"5337\">How to Order from Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"5339\" data-end=\"5368\">Start in Just a Few Steps<\/h3>\n<ol data-start=\"5370\" data-end=\"5601\">\n<li data-start=\"5370\" data-end=\"5418\">\n<p data-start=\"5373\" data-end=\"5418\">Submit your desired dimensions or box style<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5419\" data-end=\"5464\">\n<p data-start=\"5422\" data-end=\"5464\">Upload artwork or request design support<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5465\" data-end=\"5519\">\n<p data-start=\"5468\" data-end=\"5519\">Choose from multiple coating and printing options<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5520\" data-end=\"5543\">\n<p data-start=\"5523\" data-end=\"5543\">Approve your proof<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5544\" data-end=\"5601\">\n<p data-start=\"5547\" data-end=\"5601\">Receive your order with <strong data-start=\"5571\" data-end=\"5599\">free nationwide shipping<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p data-start=\"5603\" data-end=\"5669\">Boxes arrive flat-packed, ready to be folded and filled as needed.<\/p>\n<h2 data-start=\"6182\" data-end=\"6229\">Why Shop Cardboard Boxes Is a Trusted Source<\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"6231\" data-end=\"6523\">\n<li data-start=\"6231\" data-end=\"6283\">\n<p data-start=\"6233\" data-end=\"6283\">Custom sizing for 4&#215;4 boxes and other dimensions<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6284\" data-end=\"6341\">\n<p data-start=\"6286\" data-end=\"6341\">Multiple finishes including Gloss, Matte, and Spot UV<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6342\" data-end=\"6381\">\n<p data-start=\"6344\" data-end=\"6381\">Free layout support and 3D mock-ups<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6382\" data-end=\"6423\">\n<p data-start=\"6384\" data-end=\"6423\">Eco-friendly and food-grade materials<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6424\" data-end=\"6470\">\n<p data-start=\"6426\" data-end=\"6470\">Competitive wholesale pricing and low MOQs<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6471\" data-end=\"6523\">\n<p data-start=\"6473\" data-end=\"6523\">Fast turnaround and free shipping across the USA<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"6525\" data-end=\"6637\">Whether you&#8217;re looking for <strong data-start=\"6552\" data-end=\"6582\">4&#215;4 cardboard boxes nearby<\/strong> or placing a bulk order online, we\u2019re ready to assist.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6639\" data-end=\"6728\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"6639\" data-end=\"6728\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Request your custom quote today and upgrade your packaging with Shop Cardboard Boxes.<\/strong><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt